        Specialized union for DatetimeIndex objects. If combine
        overlapping ranges with the same DateOffset, will be much
        faster than Index.union

        Parameters
        ----------
        other : DatetimeIndex or array-like

        Returns
        -------
        y : Index or DatetimeIndex
